<li><strong>Written estimate with options.</strong> Depending on what we find, options might include re-pitching and resealing existing gutters, replacing damaged sections, upsizing gutters and downspouts, adding drip edge, replacing rotted fascia, or adding guards.</li>
<li><strong>Installation.</strong> Gutters are hung with a consistent slope toward downspouts, secured with hangers into solid framing, and paired with extensions that carry water away from the foundation.</li>
