</ol>

<h2>Central Texas Weather and Your Gutters</h2>
<p>Temple sees intense thunderstorms in spring and fall, and the area is known for heavy downpours that can lead to flash flooding. Gutters that handle a light shower fine may overflow in a storm like that. Hail can dent gutters and downspouts, and while dents in gutters are usually cosmetic, they can also indicate that the roof took hits worth inspecting; our <a href="/services/hail-damage-roof-repair-temple-tx/">hail damage roofing</a> page covers that. Summer heat causes aluminum gutters to expand and contract, which works seams loose over time. Live oaks and pecans common in older neighborhoods and near Lake Belton drop leaves, catkins and debris that clog gutters faster than many homeowners expect.</p>

